/target
*.swp

# Packet implementation runs are local, resumable state and diagnostics.
# Keep approved planning tasks and contracts under .kool-ade-packet/planning
# trackable; exclude per-run reports, responses, verification, locks, and state.
.kool-ade-packet/implementation/
.kool-ade-packet/**/run.lock
.kool-ade-packet/**/activity.json
.kool-ade-packet/**/state.json
.kool-ade-packet/**/*.tmp
